ex.verdict.inaccuracy.b6.2 = Onnauwkeurig. {best}.
ex.verdict.inaccuracy.b6.3 = {best} was beter.
# Level 6, an inaccuracy at the bottom of its class (deeper searches often clear it): a hedged word.
ex.verdict.inaccuracy.maybe = {best} was misschien net iets preciezer.
ex.verdict.inaccuracy.maybe.2 = Ik had misschien {best} gespeeld.
# A dubious move that loses material (levels 3-6): the remark alone, never "a bit better" (at level 6
